        "Content": "Five-bedroom semi-detached family home, approx. 142.13 sq. m. (1,530 sq. ft.) of well-proportioned accommodation.\r\n\r\nSelf-contained own-door apartment, ideal for independent living, guests, a home office, or potential rental or income use.\r\n\r\nPrivate west-facing rear garden, landscaped, spacious and ideal for outdoor dining and family entertaining.\r\n\r\nAmple off-street parking, generous corner-site position with a brick-paviour driveway.\r\n\r\nBright open-flow living spaces, spacious sitting room, dining room and kitchen cum breakfast room with direct garden access.\r\n\r\nFour upstairs bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, including a master bedroom with a remodelled en-suite.\r\n\r\nQuiet, mature residential setting, located in a cul-de-sac of just 13 homes in sought-after Bailis Manor, Athlumney.\r\n\r\nExcellent commuter location, convenient access to the M3, N2 and R147, with Navan town centre approx. 2 km away.\r\n\r\nPVC double glazed windows, PVC fascia, soffits and gutters.\r\n\r\nBuilt c. 1998. Alarmed."
